# Per-Dockerfile ignore file (BuildKit convention: <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# takes precedence over the plain .dockerignore for that specific build) --
# this image only ever COPYs dashboard/ and shared/, so nothing else
# (api/, inference/, ingest/, terminal/, models/*.pt, and the full
# requirements.txt) needs to be in this build's context at all. Deny-by-
# default, matching the root .dockerignore's own convention.
*

!requirements-dashboard.txt
!dashboard/
!shared/

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.bak
**/.DS_Store
